WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.310
- [Retsuko] I can't get hurt anymore.

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:07.030
I'm no one special in the
grand scheme of things,

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:09.650
it's time I live with
my feet on the ground.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.930
10 more seconds, yeah?

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.403
That's all I'm asking for.

00:00:14.131 --> 00:00:16.631
(metal music)

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.196
- [Gori] Invest it, what do you say?

00:00:20.196 --> 00:00:22.020
- [Retsuko] What, give you my money?

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.850
- [Washimi] Well Gori's new
project's in need of capital.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.140
- [Fenneko] If you keep
blowing cash on your

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.486
virtual boyfriend you'll
end up in the poor house.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:31.967
(engine accelerates)

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:35.440
- [Retsuko] Uh, I'm so
sorry. Are you hurt?

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.100
- [Hyoudo] As such I hereby appoint you

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.480
accounting director for the group.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.357
Not a bad deal, right?

00:00:41.357 --> 00:00:43.110
- [Fenneko And Haida] So what's the deal?

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.533
- [Retsuko] Nothing,
I'm just a little beat.

00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:47.589
I don't have enough money for this.

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.449
Especially not now.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:51.203
- [Fenneko And Haida]
She lied to our faces.

00:00:56.029 --> 00:00:57.300
- [Retsuko] It says
I'm accounting director

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.200
but I'm just a gopher.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.770
- [Hyoudo] You really think
we're selling them the music?

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.720
We're offering them the fan experience.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:06.140
- [Manaka] You're not even woman enough

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.140
to stand up for your own dreams.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:10.980
I know which one of us I'd rather be.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:12.480
- [Haida] Why can't
she just tell us stuff,

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.520
what do you think we are to her?

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:16.989
- [Fenneko] We're those
friends you see at work.

00:01:16.989 --> 00:01:19.169
- [Retsuko] I don't
know what I want to do.

00:01:19.169 --> 00:01:21.587
Those people have no idea.

00:01:21.587 --> 00:01:23.754
(screams)

00:01:28.753 --> 00:01:31.170
(soft music)

00:01:37.903 --> 00:01:40.153
When I count to 10, I'm...

